#question(title: [Sets described by distance], centered: true)[
  Let $a in RR$. Let $delta > 0$.  \
  What are the following sets? Describe them
  using intervals

  + $display(A = {x in RR thick : thick abs(x) < delta})$
  + $display(B = {x in RR thick : thick abs(x) > delta})$
  + $display(C = {x in RR thick : thick abs(x - a) < delta})$
  + $display(D = {x in RR thick : thick 0 < abs(x - a) < delta})$
]
